        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Salt and Sacrifice is a 2D action role-playing game developed by Ska Studios and released in 2022. It serves as a follow-up to Salt and Sanctuary, introducing a more open, hunt-focused structure. Players take on the role of a Marked Inquisitor tasked with tracking and defeating powerful mages across interconnected regions.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Salt and Sacrifice es un juego de rol de acción en 2D desarrollado por Ska Studios y lanzado en 2022. Es la continuación de Salt and Sanctuary y presenta una estructura más abierta, centrada en la caza. Los jugadores asumen el papel de un Inquisidor Marcado encargado de rastrear y derrotar a poderosos magos en regiones interconectadas.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
